          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every Midsummer system is made to order by two artisans, which means dimensions, heights, fabrics and comfort levels are specification decisions rather than exceptions. Send us the plan and the fabric direction; we return a technical proposal, a sample set and a delivery window.</p>",
